WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.103
A pollutant does not dissolve just because a polymer

00:00:04.103 --> 00:00:07.349
assembly is drawn around it. Chemical affinity still

00:00:07.349 --> 00:00:08.973
has to be established.

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:20.113
Polycyclic aromatic hydrocarbons resist easy dispersion

00:00:20.113 --> 00:00:24.386
in aqueous environments. Polymer assemblies offer one

00:00:24.386 --> 00:00:26.827
route to changing exposure.

00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:34.706
Amphiphilic polymer micelles can provide compartments

00:00:34.706 --> 00:00:37.962
for hydrophobic compounds. The thermodynamic argument

00:00:37.962 --> 00:00:41.219
begins before the mixture is made.

00:00:46.450 --> 00:00:49.846
Actual diblock-copolymer handling and dissolution did

00:00:49.846 --> 00:00:54.373
not always match our expectations. This archive retains

00:00:54.373 --> 00:00:56.071
an unsuccessful experiment.

00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:05.208
Micellisation depends on solvent, composition and real

00:01:05.208 --> 00:01:08.966
processing. No neat drawing replaces measurements on

00:01:08.966 --> 00:01:11.113
the system actually prepared.

00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:18.589
The original materials trials include failures. They

00:01:18.589 --> 00:01:22.625
stay in this story, because phase behaviour is not

00:01:22.625 --> 00:01:24.867
obliged to follow our calculations.

00:01:30.450 --> 00:01:33.317
The difference between an ideal formulation and a

00:01:33.317 --> 00:01:36.902
workable one can be a physical materials problem, not a

00:01:36.902 --> 00:01:38.694
failure to know the theory.

00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:51.083
The hypothesis is that polymeric micelles may alter PAH

00:01:51.083 --> 00:01:54.172
partitioning; the laboratory must decide which

00:01:54.172 --> 00:01:55.717
formulations do so.
